--- a/README
+++ b/README
@@ -22,6 +22,18 @@ from Mobile Data APNs).
 
 Please read "Configuring the Modem Manager Plugin" for configuration.
 
+oFono specific notes
+===========================
+Build with -Dofono=true (and -Dmodemmanager=disabled if ModemManager is not
+used). The oFono plugin talks to oFono on the system bus, whichever bus
+mmsd-tng runs on. It uses the first modem that has a SIM, a connection manager
+and push notifications, receives WAP push messages through a push
+notification agent (and only accepts them from oFono), and takes the MMSC,
+the MMS proxy and the DNS servers from oFono's MMS context, which it brings up
+when it needs to send or retrieve and takes down again when it is idle. When
+the MMS context has the same APN as the internet context, it uses the
+internet context instead and leaves the MMS context alone.
+
 Compiling mmsd-tng
 ============================
 In order to compile proxy daemon you need following software packages:
